message: "If you use PICO in research, teaching, or another project, please cite the software using this metadata."
title: "PICO — Personal Intelligence Coordinator & Operator"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Lurkaee"
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Lurkaee/PICO"
abstract: >-
  PICO is a local-first, privacy-first personal intelligence system built as
  an orchestrated set of components. It coordinates private context, memory,
  model-provider routing, reviewable workflow proposals, and policy-gated tool
  execution, with explicit authorization and independent verification for
  consequential actions.
